            <use href="/images/icons/global.svg?v=7#lightbulb" />
          </svg>
          <h3 class="h4">Expert knowledge</h3>
          <ul class="trust-card__list">
            <li>All our specialists have traveled extensively or lived in their specialist regions</li>
            <li>The same specialist will handle your trip from start to finish</li>
            <li>Make the most of your time and budget</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col col--sm-1/2 col--lg-1/4">
